Now \(B\) must satisfy \(BK=14\) and \(B\) on line through A making right angle with AC. Let’s parameterize: Let \(B = (b,0)\) after rotating axes? Actually we can let AB be along x-axis, AC along y-axis. Then \(B=(b,0)\), \(C=(0,c)\).

