**Step 10 – Choose appropriate \(\alpha\)**  
Both positive. Which yields points inside? Likely both work but area might be same? Let's pick one, say \(t = \frac{\sqrt3}{12}\). Then \(\tan\alpha = \sqrt3/12\), so \(\alpha\) small.

